<title>PHILIPPINES: BPI 1996 audited net at 4.013 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>BPI 1996 audited net at 4.013 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in million pesos unless stated)</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (pesos)     6.52 vs 5.43</p>
<p>    Net income (billion)	    4.013 vs 2.946</p>
<p>    Cash div per share(pesos)	4.82 vs 1.27</p>
<p>Note: Full name - Bank of the Philippine Islands. The 1995 figure was restated to include figures of CityTrust Banking Corp, which merged with BPI in late 1996.</p>
<p>-- Manila newsroom (632) 841 8937</p>
</text>
